'' A MODULE IS A NAMESPACE TO THE RUNTIME-NAME RULE (fbc's error 4, TKO0813): 'dim as long out'
'' in a module's procedure is accepted, as it is inside a NAMESPACE, where fb/tui.bi had it
'' before it became std/tui. In the global namespace it is still TKO0813 (rtl-name-clash).
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/modules/src/rtlname/main.bas -o tests/modules/rtlname.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/rtlname.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 3
